  <ThingDef ParentName= "HelghastArmorMachineableBase">
    <defName>Apparel_HG_Officerhat</defName>
    <label>Helghan Officer Hat</label>
    <description>Typically worn by commissioned officers ranked captain and above, and usually in safe rear echelon posts, this authoritative cap is a sign of distinction - few such pieces of clothing are produced, as the Helghan military usually wishes to encourage frontline service among its officer corps. These were perhaps more commonly seen during peacetime or at important state events. Regardless, its a symbol of power in the regime. Some officers believe in wearing this despite the risks is worth it for the confidence it exudes for its wearer.</description>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <recipeMaker>
